{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11231010.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11231010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11231010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1123101001:0":{"text":"아... 안 돼! 넌 우리를 거절할 권리가 없어!","source_cn":"不……不！你无权拒绝我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E34837EA1A17CC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1123101002:0":{"text":"이건 우리의 마지막 영광을 빼앗는 짓이라고요!","source_cn":"你这是剥夺我们最后的荣耀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FBDF97AB649087C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123101003:0":{"text":"폭풍이 물러갈 때, 먼지는 마침내 모래바다로 돌아가겠지.","source_cn":"风暴退去之时，尘土终将回归沙海","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5D4472E81A8E0DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123101004:0":{"text":"우리를 떠나보낼 시간인 거야.","source_cn":"是时候让我们离开了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C4EE83670601BE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奎帕":{"text":"퀴파","source":"奎帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:穆尔坎":{"text":"무르칸","source":"穆尔坎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:戴恩":{"text":"데인","source":"戴恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11231020.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11231020","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11231020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123102001:1":{"text":"우리 둘 다 잘 알고 있을 겁니다, 크루거 님.\n아니, 이제는... 크루거 족장님이라고 불러야겠군요.","source_cn":"你和我都清楚，克鲁格大人。\\n哼，也许现在应该说……克...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C6E46B04E993CB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123102002:1":{"text":"전장에서 전사하지 못한 건 유감이지만, 여기에 계속 머무르는 건 우리에게는 굴욕만 될 뿐입니다.","source_cn":"不能战死沙场已经是我们的遗憾了，继续留在这里只会让我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8E41D0D0D7B4C23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123102003:1":{"text":"진정해, 퀴파.\n크루거 족장님도 악의는 없었을 거야...","source_cn":"冷静点，奎帕。\\n克鲁格族长没有恶意……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x566BAB5733805AB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123102004:1":{"text":"악의가 없다고? 하쉬르가 어떻게 떠났는지 너도 봤을 텐데?","source_cn":"没有恶意？哈什尔是怎么离开的，你应该清楚的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x377AA2BBBA76709F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123102005:1":{"text":"하쉬르 님... 에휴.","source_cn":"哈什尔大人……唉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEDD376BC623820D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index"