:""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11231050.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11231050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11231050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1123105001:1":{"text":"마스터, 저 사람 움직인 거 같지 않아요?","source_cn":"主人，他好像动了一下？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE02FA9AEE6970330","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 저 사람 움직인 거 같지 않아요?","female":"마스터, 저 사람 움직인 거 같지 않아요?","variant_male_record_index":"127502","variant_female_record_index":"127503","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123105002:1":{"text":"혹시 귀가 안 좋은가? <style=\"highlight\">전장의 춤</style>을 사용해서 하쉬르를 깨워보자.","source_cn":"该不会是听力不好吧？再使用<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21B750AB07298EB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11231055.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11231055","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11231055","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1123105501:0":{"text":"누구냐!","source_cn":"你们是什么人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AE3026DD320374F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哈什尔":{"text":"하쉬르","source":"哈什尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11231060.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11231060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11231060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123106001:1":{"text":"시끄러워 죽겠군! 곧 죽을 노인네 귀찮게 하지 말고 원하는 게 있으면 전부 가져가!","source_cn":"吵死了！想拿什么就拿吧！何必打扰我这将死的老人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42C2B7775C1C5C3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123106002:1":{"text":"어라? 들을 수 있었네요? 아니, 그게 아니라! 우린 강도가 아니에요!","source_cn":"什么！原来你听得见！啊！不对，我们才不是强盗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0C227A3E76ADAA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123106003:1":{"text":"강도? 흥! \n뭔가 빼앗아 가고 싶어도 정말로 내어줄 게 없는 몸이다.","source_cn":"强盗，哼。\\n就算你们想抢，对于我来说也没有什么真正能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3BBC6D94A6EB88E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1123106003":{"text":"강도? 흥! \n뭔가 빼앗아 가고 싶어도 정말로 내어줄 게 없는 몸이다.","source_cn":"强盗，哼。\\n就算你们想抢，对于我来说也没有什么真正能失去的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3BBC6D94A6EB88E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1123106004:1":{"text":"크루거와 내가 무슨 상관이지? 그가 블랙하울의 족장이 되었다 한들, 난 블랙하울 부족의 사람이 아니게 된 지 오래다.","source_cn":"克鲁格与我有什么关系？即便他现在是族长，我也早就不是黑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x356859C750BD681B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123106005:1":{"text":"나는 블랙하울 부족이 흘린 더러운 핏방울일 뿐이야.\n더러운 피가 다시 흘러간들 상처를 감염시키기만 할 뿐이라는 걸 모르지 않겠지.","source_cn":"我不过是黑嚎氏族滴下的一滴污血罢了。\\n污血再流回去也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0EEC4E547037A0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1123106006:1":{"text":"한 번 지나가면 돌이킬 수 없는 일들이 많은 법이니.","source_cn":"很多事情一旦过去，就无法回头了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F7880E61BE868E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1123106007:1":{"text":"하지만 이 근처에는 야수들이 있어요! 여기 있으면 위험하다고요!","source_cn":"可是，这附近似乎有一些野兽，留在这里好危险！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA15838C2A0F5E190","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1123106008:1":{"text":"외지인은 몰라. 내가 다시 돌아간다고 한들 부족에는 아무런 도움이 되지 않는다.\n나약함과 존엄이 공존할 수 없는 것이라면, 나는 존엄을 택하겠어.","source_cn":"外族人是不会懂的，即便我回去也无法对氏族做出贡献。\\n...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9123B4E904998CE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title